- **SDK Version:** FriendSDK v0.1 (simulated integration included)
### Game Controls & Rules
- **Controls:**
 - **Desktop:** WASD / Arrow Keys, or click/tap adjacent tiles directly.
 - **Mobile:** On-screen Virtual D-Pad / Touch controls.
- **Rules:**
 - Navigate from the maze start to the glowing goal point.
 - Optional: Pick up Gem Shards (+10 $RAREFRIENDS bonus).
 - Reaching the goal triggers a victory state and awards **100 $RAREFRIENDS**.
 - Click "Next Level" to generate a larger, symmetrical procedural maze with fresh rewards.
### Technical & Compatibility Checks
- **SDK Integration:** Built within the 960 × 640 target resolution bounds.
- **Accessibility:** Touch, keyboard, audio mute toggle, and high-contrast tile layout supported.
- **Simulated Contracts:** Token minting and wallet authorization are fully simulated in accordance with MVP submission guidelines.
- **Known Issues:** None. Runs entirely in standard modern web browsers via pure standard HTML5 Canvas & Web Audio API without external npm build steps.
